          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            An air fryer is a small convection oven, and that is both its strength and its limit. For one to three people it is faster, cheaper to run and less fuss than the oven for most weeknight food, and it uses far less oil than deep frying.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
